    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u300cBe the King of a False World\u300d</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff11\uff0eTo Discover and Fix\u00a0<u>[Anomaly]</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something wrong with this world, there are many <u>[Anomaly]</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/117e75fc03174f6b59e8c14d2fbe86ea.poster.avif?t=1733393839\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/117e75fc03174f6b59e8c14d2fbe86ea.webm?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/117e75fc03174f6b59e8c14d2fbe86ea.mp4?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>[Anomaly]</u> can be Fixed to normal by hitting the shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/611773bcd1c6f783bc28cb2106903fe3.poster.avif?t=1733393839\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/611773bcd1c6f783bc28cb2106903fe3.webm?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/611773bcd1c6f783bc28cb2106903fe3.mp4?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff12\uff0eDiscover <u>[Anomaly]</u> by comparing the \u201cTrue time\u201d with the \u201cFalse time.\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u201cTrue time,\u201d in which the true appearance is seen, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the \u201cFalse time,\u201d in which the false appearance is seen, switch periodically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any suspicious part when comparing these two times is suspected of being <u>[Anomaly]</u>, Fixed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/34672b8ba58dc7d294f0ef8af131000f.poster.avif?t=1733393839\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/34672b8ba58dc7d294f0ef8af131000f.webm?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/34672b8ba58dc7d294f0ef8af131000f.mp4?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff13\uff0eScore higher than the others and be the King.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are others in this world who have modified <u>[Anomaly]</u> (multi play).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/835c06b3612fb2161d06cba645821b8d.poster.avif?t=1733393839\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/835c06b3612fb2161d06cba645821b8d.webm?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/835c06b3612fb2161d06cba645821b8d.mp4?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The competition is based on the score obtained by modifying <u>[Anomaly]</u>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The one with the highest score becomes the King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/2e6449388b332c2120c43b3a3b81bb57.poster.avif?t=1733393839\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/2e6449388b332c2120c43b3a3b81bb57.webm?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/2e6449388b332c2120c43b3a3b81bb57.mp4?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(A mode to play against the CPU will also be implemented.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff14\uff0eUnlock various elements with the rewards earned from winning.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store to purchase character skins, accessories, emotes, and other customizations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/9b7c2fdded1d28d4245ef7deeb1a4759.poster.avif?t=1733393839\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/9b7c2fdded1d28d4245ef7deeb1a4759.webm?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339920/extras/9b7c2fdded1d28d4245ef7deeb1a4759.mp4?t=1733393839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff15\uff0eUse your unique abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters, each with different abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various characters to correct <u>[Anomaly]</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and become the <strong>King of the False World.</strong>      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
